Package: JMotion
Title: Package for Analyzing data related to Animation
Version: 1.0.0
Author@R:
	person("John", "Westbrook", , "johnwestbrook@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Contains functions geared towards motion graphics and music.
	Created as a set of animation tools for aspects of motion, such as 
	matching music to frame timing and generating paths for moving objects.
Depends: R (>= 4.3.3)
